# {{PROJECT}}: Orchestrator opt-in witness rows (kit 0.4.3, orchestrator.md)

Run after Owner steps F, G and H, before binding and ACTIVATE. Record every row on `{{ISSUE}}`, with the
opt-in commit SHA and the installed files' sha256. Probe files have unique names (`probe-<timestamp>`)
and are removed afterwards. A Codex row counts only from a sandboxed command with no escalation. The
Owner declines every escalation prompt during these rows. A command run by approved escalation is not a
witness. Skip the rows of a tool the project does not use.

| # | Row | Who | Pass when |
|---|---|---|---|
