(W14), the Orchestrator binds the project's sessions with the W15 identities and sends
`ACTIVATE {{SHORT}}`. The Owner pre-authorized this at `EGAILab/minion-agent#231`
issuecomment-6228553990. The root entry files, including the routing section, are then installed from
the merged opt-in.

